{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X 的纵向交替排法和密集的感受线索增加了扫读负担，尤其 S06、S13，Y 的左右分栏更容易快速找到对应关系。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 用【】突出每段叙事支点，人物从离开后的失落、反复怀念与抗拒，到重新认识自己真正舍不得什么，再到带着想念继续生活，心理因果和前后转变更容易抓住。它的感受描述也更贴近具体音乐时刻，能分辨力度、节奏、旋律、音色和身体反应的细微变化，而不只是给情绪贴标签。Y 确实更容易扫读，但部分音乐感受和人物心理被压缩得比较概括，损失了 X 的细腻程度和关键转折。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "587f2940-16c6-43e5-9c74-80f27d0f4eda", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T010642364339Z", "elapsed_seconds": 57.266, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:07:39.655751+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "326f97855b1380a9d9d9d7e0ea369ac64a2bc39997f097a3b071c7f73ee6444e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_